{
  "$comment": "Published forms of the API stub (GET /public/v1/forms/{slug}) and of the unit tests. 'spike-abstract' is the small form of the 0.1.0 spike written as a definition, so that the browser tests of the embed, the moment after Send and the probes keep proving the same things on the real renderer; 'spike-unlisted' is the same form with an empty site list. 'itema-2026-abstract' is the abstract form of FR-FORM-04 with the fields of the current ITEMA form (FORMS); 'itema-2026-closed' is that form after its deadline. Invented people only, on example.test.",
